{"version":1,"content":"<p>【突發 ⚠️】任天堂 Nintendo Switch 2 因其中一款遊戲存在漏洞遭攻破並成功越獄後，開源社群便釋出了首款 Switch 2 PC 平台模擬器「Eden-NX2」。</p><p>雖然目前仍處於初期測試階段，但已經能順利執行多款 Switch 2 遊戲，並且擁有不俗的流暢度。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-01T03:38:12.942550+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":138,"images":0,"source":"HKEPC","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-31T04:09:59+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-01T03:59:24.875830+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-01T03:30:42.065537+00:00","content_hash":"34ff5970e9fc38d3dbb9b25c85dbc13be18293086d8928c0bf83260a2031c559","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}